@startuml
title CETP Client — Deployment / Network Topology

node "Konnektor (Kubernetes pod)" as Kon {
  artifact "konnektor-soap-server" as SOAP {
    component "KonnektorEventService\n(Subscribe/Unsubscribe/Renew/Get)" as EvtSvc
  }
  artifact "cetp-client-lib" as CETPLIB {
    component "CetpClient\n(@ObservesAsync)" as CC
    component "SubscriptionService" as SS
    component "CetpEventSender\n(Netty TCP/TLS)" as Sender
  }
  artifact "quarkus-sicct-extension" as SICCT {
    component "SmkCSAKAut\n(C.AK.AUT, HSM/P12)" as Smk
  }
  database "Konnektor DB\n(CETP_SUBSCRIPTION,\nCETP_CLIENT_ENDPOINT)" as DB
}

node "gSMC-K / HSM" as HSM
node "Client System\n(event sink)" as CS {
  component "CETP server\ncetp://host:port" as Sink
}

EvtSvc --> SS : create/persist
SS --> DB
CC --> SS : read valid subs
CC --> Sender : deliver
Sender ..> Smk : client identity (mTLS)
Smk ..> HSM : C.AK.AUT key (PKCS#11)
Sender --> Sink : TCP/TLS\n"CETP"+len+Event XML\n(PKIX trust of server cert)

note right of Sender
  CETP1: TLS (mandatory) — mutual auth on request
  CETP2: plain TCP
  2 s per-attempt timeout
end note
@enduml
